The first time you take damage each turn, you regenerate [7%, 9%, 11%, 13%, 14% (TL1-5)] of the damage dealt as mana (up to a maximum of [6.00, 7.34, 8.37, 9.24, 10 (TL1-5)]) and [6%, 10%, 13%, 15%, 17% (TL1-5)] as equilibrium (up to [5.00, 6.72, 7.73, 8.45, 9.00 (TL1-5)]).

Increases Physical Power by 30, increases damage done with shields by [29%, 42%, 51%, 59%, 66% (TL1-5)], and allows you to dual-wield shields.

Also, all of your melee attacks will perform a shield bash in addition to their normal effects.
